.734  Tw (tion to work towards a United Ireland, and some expression of their all-Ireland identity.) TjETBT0.9267 0 0 0.9795 38.4 656.4  Tm/F0 12  Tf0.0188  Tc -0.0472  Tw (The right of the people of Northern Ireland to decide their own future, with no change) Tj0.518 -17.8873  TD 0.0126  Tc -0.0924  Tw (in the constitutional position without their consent) TjETBT0.9812 0 0 0.9812 39.12 618.48  Tm/F3 11  Tf0.0119  Tc 0.3687  Tw (In 1988 we published a very detailed and imaginative set of proposals which we entitled \223Governing) Tj-0.4892 -17.6106  TD 0.0113  Tc 1.3315  Tw (with Consent\224. That Principle of Consent, which insists that the constitutional future of Northern) Tj0.4892 -17.6106  TD 0.0208  Tc 1.1872  Tw (Ireland is a matter to be decided by the people here, has always been a fundamental principle for   ) Tj0  Tc 0.12  Tw ( ) Tj-0.4892 -17.8552  TD 0.0095  Tc 0.681  Tw (Alliance. It remains so, and we are encouraged that it is has been so fully endorsed in the Downing) Tj0.7338 -17.8552  TD 0.0299  Tc 0.4564  Tw (Street Declaration, the Framework Documents, and most recently in the Draft Report of the Forum) Tj-0.2446 -17.8552  TD 0.009  Tc 1.0076  Tw (for Peace and Reconciliation. It is the recognition and respecting of this principle which makes the) Tj0.7338 -17.6106  TD 0.0275  Tc 0.7645  Tw (achievement of a settlement in Ireland a realistic prospect.) Tj-0.2446 -35.4659  TD 0.0238  Tc 1.3339  Tw (There is another side to this principle, and it is the consent of the minority to the) Tj0  Tc 0.12  Tw ( ) TjETBT0.9795 0 0 0.9795 471.12 479.28  Tm/F0 12  Tf0.0465  Tc -0.0626  Tw (way ) TjETBT0.9812 0 0 0.9812 500.88 479.28  Tm/F3 11  Tf-0.0635  Tc 2.3861  Tw (in which) Tj-469.8618 -17.8552  TD 0.0159  Tc 0.9074  Tw (Northern Ireland is governed. This other dimension of consent is also an essential feature. Dealing) Tj0 -17.6106  TD 0.0117  Tc 0.7544  Tw (with this will amongst other things involve reaching agreement to ensure that those with responsi-) Tj0.2446 -18.0998  TD 0.0165  Tc 1.3414  Tw (bility for the law and its administration, receive the respect without which no society can give its) Tj0.2446 -17.6106  TD 0.0255  Tc 0.7054  Tw (citizens a sense of safety and security.) TjETBT0.9939 0 0 0.9939 40.8 374.64  Tm/F0 14  Tf-0.0211  Tc 1.0727  Tw (The Process of Reaching a Settlement) TjETBT0.9267 0 0 0.9795 40.8 339.84  Tm/F0 12  Tf-0.0009  Tc 0.5697  Tw (The Mitchell Principles) TjETBT0.9812 0 0 0.9812 41.52 322.08  Tm/F3 11  Tf0.0384  Tc 1.7642  Tw (If we are ever to reach a negotiated settlement, the parties must be committed to Talks and an) Tj-0.2446 -17.3661  TD 0.0211  Tc 2.2058  Tw (honorable compromise. The issues must be resolved through the force of argument, rather than) Tj0 -17.8552  TD 0.0091  Tc 1.7414  Tw (the use of violence. The Alliance Party remains fully committed to the Mitchell Principles as the) Tj0.2446 -17.6106  TD 0.0225  Tc 0.2409  Tw (basis for the current Talks. It is regrettable that the strength of those principles has been diluted by) Tj0 -18.0998  TD 0.033  Tc 0.7312  Tw (the actions of certain parties and the response of the two governments.) Tj-0.2446 -18.0998  TD 0.0142  Tc 2.507  Tw (Alliance fully supports the recommendations of the Mitchell Report that decommissiomng occur) Tj0.7338 -18.3444  TD 0.0321  Tc 1.2435  Tw (alongside talks, in the context of ceasefire from both sets of paramilitaries.) TjETBT0.9795 0 0 0.9795 32.16 196.32  Tm/F5 12  Tf-0.0592  Tc 0.5209  Tw ( 6 ) Tj14.9469 0  TD /F2 12  Tf0.2155  Tc 5.9987  Tw (Alliance Manifesto 1997) TjETendstreamendobj35 0 obj5643endobj33 0 obj<</MediaBox [ 0 0 614 1010 ]/Type /Page/Parent 5 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F0 10 0 R /F2 19 0 R /F3 21 0 R /F5 36 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 34 0 R>>endobj39 0 obj<</Length 40 0 R>>stream
