  Tc 0  Tw (l) TjETBT0.9812 0 0 0.9812 57.12 562.8  Tm/F3 11  Tf0.0151  Tc 1.0218  Tw (Further development of Career Guidance within the school system with a strong emphasis) Tj0.2446 -18.3444  TD -0.0039  Tc 0.9189  Tw (on \221learning how to learn, for living and working\222.) TjETBT0.7595 0 0 0.9598 28.8 529.44  Tm/F4 5  Tf0.1528  Tc 0  Tw (l) TjETBT0.9812 0 0 0.9812 57.36 527.04  Tm/F3 11  Tf0.0161  Tc 0.9072  Tw (NVQ systems should be expanded to encourage the over 35 age group, and financial support) Tj0.2446 -18.3444  TD -0.0012  Tc 0.9439  Tw (during training and restraining should reflect current wage levels rather than social) Tj0.2446 -18.0998  TD 0.0267  Tc 1.3158  Tw (security benefits.) TjETBT0.8976 0 0 0.9598 29.04 475.44  Tm/F4 5  Tf0.0542  Tc 0  Tw (l) TjETBT0.9812 0 0 0.9812 57.6 473.04  Tm/F3 11  Tf0.0177  Tc 0.958  Tw (Long-term unemployed should be given the opportunity to regain the work ethic, and) Tj0.4892 -18.3444  TD 0.0166  Tc 0.9999  Tw (emphasis placed on new skills and experience.) TjETBT0.8286 0 0 0.9598 29.52 439.2  Tm/F4 5  Tf0.0976  Tc 0  Tw (l) TjETBT0.9812 0 0 0.9812 58.32 437.04  Tm/F3 11  Tf-0.0029  Tc 1.1556  Tw (Greater emphasis on in-service training and management training within industry,) Tj0 -18.0998  TD 0.0294  Tc 0.6403  Tw (commerce and the public sector.) Tj-29.1065 -36.9334  TD 0.0192  Tc 0.9157  Tw (In the future, few people will work in a full-time career for life. Many will develop a portfolio of) Tj0.2446 -18.3444  TD 0.0025  Tc 1.4423  Tw (part-time jobs, which will change throughout their working life. Education, training, social secu-) Tj0.2446 -17.8552  TD 0.0195  Tc 0.8051  Tw (rity, taxation and pension schemes will all have to change to facilitate this. If we prepare for it,) Tj0.2446 -18.8336  TD 0.0064  Tc 1.0055  Tw (the world of work can be a much more individually fulfilling experience than ever before. If we do) Tj0 -18.0998  TD 0.0184  Tc 0.7586  Tw (not 